-- test: `Complex` takes `F64` or `F32` (U2002); the arguments of `complex` have one float type, and a complex value and a real one do not mix in an operator, on either side, with repairs to `scale(by:)` and `complex(re: x, im: 0.0)`; `Complex` is not ordered and has no `mod`; a missing argument of `complex` is U2001
-- spec: spec/29 §19
-- expect: error U2002 at src/m.una:15:14
-- expect: error U2001 at src/m.una:17:64
-- expect: error U2001 at src/m.una:19:51
-- expect: error U2001 at src/m.una:21:54
-- expect: error U2001 at src/m.una:23:63
-- expect: error U2001 at src/m.una:25:59
-- expect: error U2001 at src/m.una:27:57
